TIP:  So many versions and ways to sing this song.  This is Judy's version and she likes to stretch out the syllables.  The lyric pacing reflects that.  Also pretty in A using (A) (D) (E) - capo 6 to match Judy, or in C using (C) (F) (G) - capo 3 to match Judy.  Nice, easy song to pick as well, not so much here in D but more so in A.


